This directory contains dav1d 1.5.3 from VideoLAN:
https://code.videolan.org/videolan/dav1d/-/tags/1.5.3

Upstream source is stored in src/. Mozilla-specific build configuration lives
in moz.build, config/, and moz/.

After importing clean upstream sources into src/, apply the local patch from
this directory:

  patch -p1 < mcp-x86-smooth-weights.patch

Update the version details above after importing a new release.

Local patch:
  mcp-x86-smooth-weights.patch - Makes the high-bit-depth smooth-weight tables
  available to 32-bit SSE builds with the required 16-byte alignment, while
  retaining the upstream AVX2 definitions on x86-64.
